<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Trigon started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Trigon started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read &amp; Co analysts James Lane and Adam Frisch started coverage of Trigon Healthcare Inc Monday with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- They set a 12- to 18-month price target of $32 a share.</p>
<p>-- In a report, they said the Richmond, Va.-based company had &quot;multiple expansion potential as earnings from MCO (managed care organizations) operations increase as percentage of total earnings.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed Friday at 24-5/16.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
